title: Julius Curtius
is-pinned-card: true 
tags: advisor, liberal
card-image: img/portraits/CurtiusJulius.jpg
new-page: true
view-if: curtius_advisor = 1

= Julius Curtius

Julius Curtius is one of our foreign policy leaders and a close ally of Stresemann's vision of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>.

- @curtius_international
- @curtius_foreign
- @coalition
- @end_game
- @root: Return to main

@curtius_international
title: International Party Relations
subtitle: Curtius is one of our contacts with international parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; international_relations_timer -= 12; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: international_relations


@curtius_foreign
title: Foreign Policy
subtitle: As Foreign Minister, Curtius can set our foreign policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?] [? if foreign_minister_party != dvp_name : The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not control the Foreign Ministry. ?][? if foreign_minister != "Curtius" : Curtius is not the Foreign Minister. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and dvp_in_government and foreign_minister_party == dvp_name and foreign_minister = "Curtius"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; foreign_policy_timer -= 8; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: foreign_policy


@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Curtis can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and dvp_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5*(1-dissent); ddp_relation += 5*(1-dissent); spd_relation += 5*(1-dissent)

We have improved our relations with the Z, [+ ddp_name +], and SPD, and reduced tensions with the coalition.


@end_game
title: End the game.
view-if: year >= 1935
choose-if: year >= 1935
subtitle: We can end the game now.
unavailable-subtitle: Curtis wants to keep playing.
go-to: 1935_end
